+# Do not dispatch axis-aligned split jobs that a sparse-oblique config over
+# numerical features guarantees will return kNoBetterSplitFound. Removes one
+# channel round-trip + mt19937 re-seed per candidate attribute per node in the
+# concurrent split manager (GBT). Bit-identical trees.
